    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag Management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Deactivate or remove the FASTag before loading to avoid damage to the tag or vehicle surface. Keep the tag in a secure pouch and note its serial number in the audit report. When the car reaches its destination, reactivate the tag to resume toll‑free travel.</p>
